      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果这么做能顺便得到\n最优秀沙土赛马娘奖的话……\n风风就收下好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "447d4160f8ad52b9883360dea52a9657fc1b0e5f8258b19296ca9140fc45da0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
